meta {
  name: Create Port (relay on expander)
  type: http
  seq: 13
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/organizations/{{orgId}}/ports
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{JWTtoken}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "name": "Estable",
    "kind": "relay",
    "pieceTypeId": {{pieceTypeId}},
    "config": {
      "expander": "exp1",
      "channel": 3
    }
  }
}

docs {
  Relé en el canal 3 del expansor `exp1` (crear antes con create-port-expander). Sin `pin`: un relé lleva pin
  **o** expander+channel (ports.pin_or_expander). El canal es único por expansor
  (ports.expander_channel_conflict) y `activeLow` no se admite aquí (lo declara el expansor).
}
